dot/issues/109782","id":3213179497,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_hTpp","user":{"login":"precup","id":709680,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwOTY4MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/709680?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup","html_url":"https://github.com/precup","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-22T06:19:39Z","updated_at":"2025-08-22T06:19:39Z","body":"huh??\n\nI can confirm every part of this. I initially tried this MRP: [109782.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21931101/109782.zip) and it had zero issues. However, Steam starts automatically for me when I log in, so I disabled that, restarted, and lo and behold, the issue appears. Opening Steam then fixes the issue.\n\n> Godot v4.5.beta (8ad3072a6) - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Single-window, 3 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2080 Ti (NVIDIA; 31.0.15.3713) - AMD Ryzen 9 3900X 12-Core Processor (24 threads) - 31.94 GiB memory","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3213179497/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":1,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3218157708","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109782#issuecomment-3218157708","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109782","id":3218157708,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_0TCM","user":{"login":"thiagola92","id":9352894,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkzNTI4OTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9352894?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thiagola92","html_url":"https://github.com/thiagola92","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thiagola92/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thiagola92/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thiagola92/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thiagola92/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thiagola92/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thiagola92/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thiagola92/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thiagola92/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thiagola92/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-24T14:36:50Z","updated_at":"2025-08-25T15:35:02Z","body":"(I'm totally ignoring why opening Steam would make work again)  \n\nCreated a fork and refactory to better understand the code, but the problem still didn't happened after the refactory:  \nhttps://github.com/thiagola92/godot/commit/567979887b0f509bfebd5ea4a040fa127e04e4e9  \n\nNot sure if I understand correctly, but I think that in Windows we have 3 states (maximized, minimized and windowed) and that fullscreen is windowed covering the entire screen.  \n\nStill have to read #88852 to understand better why a non-exclusive fullscreen is basically borderless maximize (and this cause the need of 2 pixels).  \n\nI notice that there is a lot of treatment for niche cases (mouse trails, taskbar hidden and others that I couldn't indentify).  \n\nEdit: Removed the part where i though that I knew the issue 😅\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3218157708/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3227099683","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109782#issuecomment-3227099683","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109782","id":3227099683,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7AWaIj","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-27T07:28:21Z","updated_at":"2025-08-27T07:28:21Z","body":"```\n\tget_window().mode = Window.MODE_MAXIMIZED\n\tget_window().mode = Window.MODE_WINDOWED\n\tprint(\"Current Window Mode \\t\", get_window().mode)\n```\nCalling mode set/get multiple times in the row won't work reliably, mode change always take some time to apply, a proper fix for it probably would be adding `in_transition` state for the `get` and stack of the requested `sets`, but this is a breaking change, so too late for 4.5.\n\nIssue is still reproducible and valid.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3227099683/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]